    "title": "Lee Isom completes offseason with sweep of golds - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joey Cooke ,\n8 hours ago\nMARATHON — With Florida High School Athletic Association state records now on the mind of Justice Lee Isom during her senior campaign, the Marathon High School three-time state champion spent the summer on the state AAU weightlifting circuit, completing the offseason a perfect eight-for-eight in gold medals, including a pair at the Florida State Championships.\nIn the summer finale, Lee Isom lifted 160 pounds during the snatch, 175 on the bench and 200 in the clean and jerk to claim the Olympic and Traditional category crowns.\nDuring the fall, Lee Isom will play golf for the Lady Fins before taking her shot at the Florida High School Athletic Association state marks, already holding the school records in her weight class. She is a three-time state champion and one-time runner-up at the FHSAA State Championships.",
